# CVE-2026-40973: Spring Boot ApplicationTemp directory hijacking
# Risk accepted: AV:L (local attacker), AC:H (high complexity),
# PR:L (low privileges). MyAm runs in an isolated Docker container
# with non-root user (appuser, uid 1001) and does not enable
# server.servlet.session.persistent (default false). Exploitation
# requires the attacker to already have access to the container/host.
CVE-2026-40973
